<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
%# Shared chrome from homelab-webtheme: theme.css, fonts and favicon come from
%# static.mailmasker.org, so these pages restyle with the rest of mailmasker
%# and need no rebuild for a colour change. Only the rules this app needs
%# live below.
%#
%# These templates replace HTML that was built with qq{} inside the
%# controller until 2026-11-03, which is why the pages had their own
%# black-on-white look.
%= include 'homelab/head'
<title><%= title %></title>
<style>
  /* A short form: a readable column, not the full page width. */
  .container { max-width: 40rem; }
  /* A long address breaks rather than pushing the page sideways on a phone. */
  .cand { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  /* The block list: one address per line, the count pushed to the right of
     the heading, and the filter taking whatever width the sort button
     leaves. */
  .bl-count { margin-left: auto; font-size: var(--app-sm); }
  .toolbar .form-input { flex: 1 1 12rem; width: auto; min-width: 0; }
  .blocklist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .blocklist li { padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .blocklist li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  /* Just added on this visit. */
  .blocklist li.is-new { color: var(--success); }
</style>
</head>
<body class="app">
%= include 'homelab/header'
<main class="app__main">
  <div class="container stack"><%= content %></div>
</main>
%= include 'homelab/footer'
</body>
</html>
